{{For|secret achievements|Secret Achievements}}
{{Keyword|ach|Achievements}} are the game's way of showing players the progression path and rewarding them for it. There are currently {{Keyword|ach|670 Achievements}} in the game.

Each {{Keyword|ach|completed achievement}} grants a multiplier bonus and some achievements have rewards (Time Flux, Souls or a game related mechanic).

=== Multiplier bonus ===
==== Before Achievement #51 ====
  <math>\text{Mult. Gain Multiplier} = 1 + (N \times 0.01)</math>

==== After Achievement #51 ====
  <math>\text{Mult. Gain Multiplier} = 1 + (N \times 0.01)</math>
  <math>\text{Generators Gain Multiplier} = 1 + (N \times 0.01)</math>

==== After Achievement #201 ====
  <math>\text{Mult. Gain Multiplier} = 1.05 ^ N \times N ^ {(\frac{N} {20} - 10)}</math>
  <math>\text{Generators Gain Multiplier} = 1.05 ^ N \times N ^ {(\frac{N} {20} - 10)}</math>
  <math>\text{Dilation Points Gain Multiplier} = 1.05 ^ N \times N ^ {(\frac{N} {20} - 10)}</math>
  <math>\text{Zodiacs Quality Multiplier} = \frac{N} {50} - 2</math>
  <math>\text{Damage Multiplier} = \frac{N} {50} - 2</math>

