** Added 80 new achievements (#161 to 240).
** 10 new secret achievements added to the game (#22 to #31).
* 1.013
** Added 2 new secret achievements to the game (#032 and #033).
** Achievements now display the unlock date (previously unlocked ones are dated January 1, 2025).
* 1.022
** Added 80 new achievements (#241 to 320).
* 1.037
** Added 11 new secret achievements (#34 to #44).
* 1.038
** Lowered the requirements for secrets #42-#44 by 4, 4, and 18.67 times respectively.
* 1.044
** Added 105 new achievements (#321 to 425).
** Added 7 new secret achievements (#45 to 51).
** Reward from achievement #320 changed from 10 runes to x1.02 rune generation.
* 1.056
** Added 95 new achievements (#426 to 520)
** Added 4 new secret achievements (#52-55)
* 1.065
** Added a revamp of the achievement UI, now splitting the achievements into 5 categories ([[Revolution]], [[Infinity]], [[Eternity]], [[Unity]], [[Secret Achievements|Secrets]]), showing how much achievements was completed in a category and showing what bonuses a category gives based on completed achievements.

